// sbt plugin declarations for the rarebert Scala module.
//
// This file is intentionally empty of project-specific plugins today, but
// it MUST exist so Metals can detect the build target on import.  Add new
// plugin declarations here, one per line, e.g.:
//
//   addSbtPlugin("ch.epfl.scala" % "sbt-bloop" % "2.0.5")
//
// The latest patch versions are tracked in the devcontainer config at
// `.devcontainer/devcontainer.json` and the sbt version pin is in
// `project/build.properties`.
